001200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001300 PROGRAM-ID.     TESCSEQ.
001400 AUTHOR.        C KALMAN.
001500*REMARKS.
001600*
001700*
001800**************************************
001900*   TESCSEQ FILLS ESCAPE VARIABLES   *
002000*   WITH ESCAPE SEQUENCES FROM FILE  *
002100*   DESCPTBL.PUB.  THIS ALLOWS FOR   *
002200*   THE USE OF ESCAPE SEQUENCES FOR  *
002300*   PRINTING OTHER THAN THOSE        *
002400*   PROVIDED BY HP.                  *
002500**************************************
002600
002700
002800 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
002900 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
003000 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
003100 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
003200
003300 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
003400 FILE-CONTROL.
003500     SELECT ESC-FILE  ASSIGN TO  DATABASE-DESCPTBL.
003600
003700
003800 DATA DIVISION.
003900 FILE SECTION.
004000 FD  ESC-FILE
004100     LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
004200     RECORD CONTAINS 480 CHARACTERS
004300     DATA RECORD IS ESC-REC.
004400 01  ESC-REC                PIC X(480).
004500
004510 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
004520
       COPY ESCNAM2 IN COPYCSIS.

004530 01  JCW-PARMS.
004540     05  JCW-NAME          PIC X(12)  VALUE SPACES.
004550     05  JCW-VALUE         PIC S9(4)  COMP  VALUE ZEROES.
004560     05  JCW-STATUS        PIC S9(4)  COMP  VALUE ZEROES.
004570
004600 LINKAGE SECTION.
004700
004800 01  ESC-AREA.
005000     05  FILLER               PIC X(480).
005100
005200
005300 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING ESC-AREA.
005400
005500 MAIN.
005510*    MOVE "NONHPPRT" TO JCW-NAME.
005520*    CALL INTRINSIC "FINDJCW" USING JCW-NAME, JCW-VALUE
005530*        JCW-STATUS.
005540*    IF JCW-VALUE = 1
005700*        OPEN INPUT ESC-FILE
005800*        READ ESC-FILE INTO ESC-AREA
005900*        AT END MOVE LOW-VALUES TO ESC-AREA
006000*         CLOSE ESC-FILE.
      *    IF JCW-VALUE NOT = 1
               MOVE ESC-NAME TO ESC-AREA.
006400 EOJ.
006500     GOBACK.
